T4 focus tunable between character-wide and chain-wide scope. This is the genuinely novel addition you're proposing — not just in your engine but in ARPG design more broadly. T4s can either modify the entire character's mechanics (the current behavior) OR narrow to affecting only skills in their own chain (or a parallel chain). This is the variance-generating move.

