Multiple T4 options per chain might cannibalize each other in unfortunate ways. If chain A has 3 T4 options and 95% of players choose option 1 because it's clearly best, options 2 and 3 are wasted content generation. Conversely, if the options are too balanced, the choice becomes arbitrary and loses meaning. The sweet spot — where each option is genuinely viable but suits different playstyles or content types — is design work that requires iteration.

