Your kit/season cycle naturally limits gear staleness. In a monthly reincarnation game, gear staleness is bounded by the season length. If a piece of gear is slightly underpowered, the cost of that mistake is limited to one season. Traditional ARPGs have years-long gear lifetimes where balance mistakes compound.

