Worth pulling on this thread because gear balance interacts with auto-combat in specific ways:

Auto-combat amplifies gear's strategic importance. When players don't control execution, gear choices are doing more of the work that execution would normally do. This means gear balance matters more in your game than in traditional ARPGs, because gear-driven differences in build performance can't be compensated for by player skill.

