Tower gear is calibrated for the hardcore curve. Drops in the tower include gear specifications appropriate for the steeper scaling — players who push deep get gear that meaningfully exceeds standard season gear, supporting their continued push.

The tower's competitive layer is seasonal. Floor depth achieved during a season is the season's tower accomplishment, recorded in seasonal leaderboards. All-time deepest floor is also tracked but the active competition resets monthly.

Standard season content uses the 85th percentile balance band. The tower is the place for hardcore progression; standard content remains tuned for the typical player experience.

This structure resolves the tensions cleanly. Players who love hardcore optimization have the tower as their permanent home. Players who prefer the season-cycle experience have the standard content. Both audiences are served by the same engine producing different content types calibrated for their respective needs.

The hardcore audience specifically
